      "name": "Keywell Encounter Priorities",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<ol><li><strong>Round 1:</strong> cast Healing Word on Edric and move toward him.</li><li><strong>Round 2:</strong> use an action to free Edric while Edric warns the party.</li><li><strong>Round 3:</strong> escort Edric and Mara toward cover or the boundary stone.</li><li><strong>Later:</strong> provide emergency healing to a downed hero; otherwise Dodge, Help, or guard the civilians.</li></ol><p>Healing Edric works normally. It changes Harald's task rather than ending the rescue objective.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
